KPL/IK

Chandrayaan-2 Orbiter IIRS Instrument Kernel
============================================

This Instrument Kernel (IK) file contains Field-Of-View (FOV) definitions for Chandrayaan-2 Orbiter Imaging Infrared Spectrometer IIRS payload.


