---------------------------------------------------------------------------

   Version 1.0 -- June 19, 2023 -- 
   SAC Optical Payload DP Team, SAC, Ahmedabad
   Flight Dynamics Group, URSC-ISRO, Bangalore


   Information provided by the Payload team - SEDA/SAC.
   
